Tandem: it2api and it2tip in this folder were copied from iTerm2
(https://github.com/gnachman/iTerm2, commit 64791fc, OtherResources/Utilities/it2api and
OtherResources/Utilities/it2tip), byte for byte, and are used under iTerm2's license.
